Here's the architectural plan for your automated expense approval flow:

---

## Plan: Expense Approval Flow

### What it does

Accepts an expense report (employee name, description, amount, receipt URL) and routes it automatically:
- **Low-value expenses** (≤ configurable threshold, e.g. $50) → **auto-approved instantly**
- **Higher-value expenses** → pauses and sends a **manager a quick-form task** (via Action Center / email) to Approve or Reject → logs the outcome

Every path ends with a structured `approvalStatus` + `managerComments` output.

---

### Flow Diagram

```mermaid
graph LR
    trigger(Manual Trigger)
    prepareExpense[Prepare Expense]
    checkThreshold{Auto-Approve Check}
    hitlManagerReview[Manager Review]
    checkManagerDecision{Manager Decision}
    logAutoApproved[Log Auto-Approved]
    logApproved[Log Approved]
    logRejected[Log Rejected]
    logError[Log Error]
    doneAutoApproved(Done Auto-Approved)
    doneApproved(Done Approved)
    doneRejected(Done Rejected)
    doneError(Done Error)
    trigger -->|output| prepareExpense
    prepareExpense -->|success| checkThreshold
    prepareExpense -->|error| logError
    checkThreshold -->|true| logAutoApproved
    checkThreshold -->|false| hitlManagerReview
    hitlManagerReview -->|outcome-completed| checkManagerDecision
    checkManagerDecision -->|true| logApproved
    checkManagerDecision -->|false| logRejected
    logAutoApproved -->|success| doneAutoApproved
    logApproved -->|success| doneApproved
    logRejected -->|success| doneRejected
    logError -->|success| doneError
```

---

### Nodes

| # | Name | Type | Role |
|---|---|---|---|
| 1 | Manual Trigger | `core.trigger.manual` | Entry point |
| 2 | Prepare Expense | `core.action.script` | Validates inputs, builds summary string |
| 3 | Auto-Approve Check | `core.logic.decision` | `amount <= autoApproveThreshold` |
| 4 | **Manager Review** | `uipath.human-in-the-loop.quick-form` | Sends manager an Approve/Reject task |
| 5 | Manager Decision | `core.logic.decision` | Branches on manager's outcome |
| 6–9 | Log nodes (×4) | `core.action.script` | Return `approvalStatus` + `managerComments` per path |
| 10–13 | End nodes (×4) | `core.control.end` | One per terminal path |

### Flow Inputs & Outputs

| | Name | Type | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| `in` | `employeeName` | string | Submitter's name |
| `in` | `expenseDescription` | string | Purpose of the expense |
| `in` | `amount` | number | Amount in USD |
| `in` | `receiptUrl` | string | Receipt link (optional) |
| `in` | `autoApproveThreshold` | number | Auto-approve limit (e.g. 50) |
| `out` | `approvalStatus` | string | `AutoApproved` / `Approved` / `Rejected` / `Error` |
| `out` | `managerComments` | string | Manager's comments (empty on auto-approve) |

